      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A general methodology for the synthesis of enantioenriched tertiary allylic aryl ethers through Pd-catalyzed decarboxylative reactions of vinyl cyclic carbonates and phenols is presented. Switching of the regioselectivity toward the formation of linear products by a judicious choice of the ligand is also reported."},
